# Zabbix stores webhook scripts with CRLF line endings and returns them that
# way over the API. core.autocrlf=input would normalise these to LF on commit,
# the checkout Argo CD builds the ConfigMap from would then differ from what is
# in Zabbix, and zabbix_mediatype would report both media types changed on
# every single sync. -text preserves the bytes exactly.
config/media/*.js -text
